<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-BALDATO WINS SEVENTH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-BALDATO WINS SEVENTH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>MARBELLA, Spain 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fabio Baldato of Italy won the 150-km seventh stage of the Tour of Spain between Malaga and Marbella on Friday.</p>
<p>Baldato retains the yellow jersey as overall leader.</p>
</text>
